"""
Colorado 14ers mountain outline pixel maps.

Converted from the supplied PNG files.
Source pixels with alpha >= 128 become solid outline pixels.

Exports:
    MOUNTAIN_OUTLINES

Usage:
    load("colorado14ers_data.star", "MOUNTAIN_OUTLINES")

    outline = MOUNTAIN_OUTLINES["blanca_peak"]

Each outline is a two-dimensional list:
    outline[y][x] == 0: empty
    outline[y][x] == 1: solid outline pixel

Original dimensions are preserved:
    Blanca Peak: 64 x 34
    All others:  64 x 32

The compact strings below encode pairs of x/y coordinates.
They are expanded into ordinary pixel grids when loaded.

Duplicate artwork in the supplied PNGs is preserved:
    crestone_needle / crestone_peak
    grays_peak / handies_peak
"""

_COORD_DIGITS = "0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz-_"

_COORD_VALUES = {
    _COORD_DIGITS[i]: i
    for i in range(64)
}

